abstract: "A finite algebra over epistemic states, implemented as a reproducible visual notation system with enforced invariants. Four-state classification (NORMATIVE / NON-NORMATIVE / CRITICAL / METACOGNITIVE) realised as the Klein four-group V4 (a finite subgroup of O(2) isomorphic to D2), encoded redundantly through color, orientation, and textual label. v2.0.0-rc is a major release candidate: it promotes the owl-only PNG lineage to the authoritative visual master and treats the human-selected gold branch / olive heritage marker as part of the source owl form before the V4 transforms (so the branch transforms with the owl rather than being a fixed decorative overlay). The V4 algebra and the sigma_h assignment to METACOGNITIVE are unchanged."
keywords:
  - visual epistemic notation
  - classification system
  - Klein four-group
  - V4
  - DNS Tool
  - documentation
  - epistemology
  - metacognition
